      "id": "portal_flow",
      "readmeTexts": [
        "Right-click a solid block with any mirror to create an entry portal.",
        "Inside a World Reflection Mirror or First Dream Mirror world, right-click a solid block to create a return portal.",
        "If that portal is far from the entrance, it returns you to the matching position in the original world.",
        "Hold right-click in the air inside a mirror world to return to that mirror world's entrance point without leaving the mirror world.",
        "Heaven Mirror worlds cannot create return portals; use the original entrance or `/iwm return`.",
        "Each player can have only one mirror session open at a time.",
        "Other players can use the same entry portal after the creator enters first",
        "If you disconnect and rejoin while the mod still has your mirror-world save state"
