      "id": "cooldowns_and_efficiency",
      "readmeTexts": [
        "Efficiency reduces both the normal mirror cooldown and the Renewal cooldown by 20% per level",
        "Creative mode ignores both the normal mirror cooldown and the Renewal cooldown.",
        "The normal mirror cooldown belongs to the player. The Renewal cooldown belongs to the First Dream Mirror item.",
        "The item bar and tooltip show Renewal cooldown, and `showCooldownHud` can show the normal mirror cooldown.",
        "The World Mirrors creative tab includes all three mirrors plus Permanence and Renewal enchanted books.",
        "In Survival, Permanence works as a normal mirror enchantment; Renewal appears only as treasure loot."
      ],
